OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween scare maze 'phenomenal'
OL,4,Afor dairy farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong tall stalks of maize on a farm in
OL,7,FStaffordshire, scare actors lurk around
OL,8,Fcorners, ready to terrify members of
OL,9,Fthe public this Halloween.
OL,11,FThe scare maze, at Caverswall Creamery
OL,12,Fin Stoke-on-Trent, is a relatively new
OL,13,Fseasonal event, having only started
OL,14,Fthree years ago.
OL,16,FHowever, its success is essential to
OL,17,Fthe farm's income - bringing in
OL,18,Fthousands of visitors to celebrate all
OL,19,Fthings spooky.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
