OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween scare maze 'phenomenal'
OL,4,Afor dairy farm
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We did need to diversify, we couldn't
OL,7,Fcarry on with what we were doing with
OL,8,Fthe dairy farming," said Dave Moseley,
OL,9,Fwho runs the site with his four sons.
